 * ServiceNow Web Component Event Utilities
 *
 * Common utilities for handling ServiceNow custom events across ALL frameworks.
 * Use the same pattern everywhere - attach event listeners directly.
 *
 * TODO: move this to a common package if/when we support other frameworks.
 */
